		{"id":"c58b47cec6343464","type":"file","file":"仓库管理系统/日程实施计划/日记/2026-07-18 仓库管理系统Day2.md","x":-480,"y":-240,"width":480,"height":860,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"1199dc2d6add27dc","type":"text","text":"# 执行器的状态迁移图\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    direction TB\n\n    [*] --> Starting : 构造函数初始化\n\n    state \"Starting (启动中)\" as Starting\n    state \"Ready (就绪)\" as Ready\n    state \"Failed (失败)\" as Failed\n    state \"Processing (处理任务)\" as Processing\n    state \"ShuttingDown (关闭中)\" as ShuttingDown\n    state \"Stopped (已停止)\" as Stopped\n\n    Starting --> Ready : 初始化成功\n    Starting --> Failed : 初始化失败\n    Ready --> Processing : 处理任务\n    Ready --> ShuttingDown : shutdown 调用\n    Processing --> ShuttingDown\n    ShuttingDown --> Stopped : 任务完成\n    ShuttingDown --> Stopped : 排空超时\n    Stopped --> ShuttingDown : 重新启动\n```\n","x":220,"y":-20,"width":430,"height":660},
		{"id":"02399b98c1e7c662","type":"text","text":"# 数据库业务执行流程\n[[数据库业务执行架构]]\n","x":220,"y":-180,"width":420,"height":120,"color":"6"}
	],
